                        "review": "I stumbled onto this game, and I thought that I might give it a try. Apparently, I have to agree with Mattchu, it REALLY needs a lot of improvements, like a pause screen, make a strict limit of lives you can carry (as I have collected so many I saw half a heart! xD), music sometimes change its volume, needs more options on the main menu, and a whole lot more bits and pieces to find that needs fixing if you guys or I can discover them for ourselves. This game was quite fun, but unfortunately I have to not recommend this game until there is further notice of updates of the game itself.",
